# The repo is authored and stored with LF. Without this, Git's core.autocrlf
# rewrites the working tree to CRLF on Windows checkouts, which does not change
# what is committed but does break the tools that read the files on disk:
# `npm run lint` reports every file as misformatted, and Vitest fails to parse
# `scripts/traction.mjs` at all. Both pass on Linux CI, so the failures look
# like real regressions and are not — several sessions have been lost to it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch these.
*.gif  binary
*.mp4  binary
*.webm binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.db   binary
